-	// Google Gemini CLI — https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli
+	// Google Gemini CLI - https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli
 	// GEMINI_CLI: https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/blob/46fd7b4864111032a1c7dfa1821b2000fc7531da/docs/tools/shell.md#L96-L97
